Error [jet.InvalidOverflowOptIn]: `saturating` must wrap a single integer `+`, `-`, `*`, or `/`, or one narrowing conversion
  --> tests/ui/overflow_word_around_widening.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(saturating(U16{small}))
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The overflow opt-ins apply to one arithmetic operation on whole numbers, or to one conversion to a fixed width that can't hold every value of its source
 Fix: Write it around one operation or conversion, e.g. `saturating(a + b)` or `saturating(U8{count})`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1005
